# Deep2 Qwen32 85TPS — Batch 8, item 57
# Base: apply after 0056.
#
# Goal:
#   QKV or Gate-Up group gets ONE contiguous mapped readback per GPU instead of
#   one readback per matrix. Host merge walks that single slab.
#
# Apply:
#   git -C F:\~dev apply --3way 0057_single_group_return_merge.patch

